<title>GERMANY: Schering says 9-mo net profit up 66 pct.</title>
<headline>Schering says 9-mo net profit up 66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   286     vs 172</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     527     vs 343</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   481     vs 448</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    527     vs 470</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,846   vs 3,449</p>
<p>    --of which domestic			557     vs 517</p>
<p>    --of which foreign			 3,289   vs 2,932</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German drugs group is Schering AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
